0000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"&gt;The following table sets forth the computation of basic and diluted earnings per share attributable to common shareholders:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:8pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:8pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"&gt;&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
